OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says no proposals on
OL,4,Atable for resolution to Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FTalks aimed at resolving the Drumcree
OL,8,Fdispute are expected to continue as
OL,9,FPortadown District Master Nigel Dawson
OL,10,Fsaid: "There are currently no proposals
OL,11,Fon the table."
OL,13,FBoth sides were given a document during
OL,14,Fseparate meetings with the Secretary of
OL,15,FState, Sir Chris Bryant, on Wednesday.
OL,17,FAfter its meeting, the chairman of the
OL,18,Fresident's coalition said his group
OL,19,Fwould agree to it, if the Orange Order
OL,20,Fdid.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
