OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order says no proposals on
OL,4,Atable for resolution to Drumcree
OL,5,Adispute
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, an Orange Order parade from
OL,8,FDrumcree into Portadown did not happen
OL,9,Fbecause of a large protest on the
OL,10,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road.
